          "text": "[Gift of Fire] After performing several attacks, the next attack deals Arts damage and Burn to the target and all your surrounding units, and inflicts [Burning Heart] on affected tiles, prioritizing your units that are not in [Burning Heart]",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Firelight] Stuns and blinds the Operator with highest ATK on the field, and summons <Fires of Days Past> in the 8 surrounding tiles",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enters Rest form when HP reaches 0",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "Rest",
          "format": "title"
        },
        {
          "text": "Summons <Fires of Days Past> around itself and recovers HP; When HP reaches max, if there are no <Fires of Days Past> on the battlefield, enters Last Dance form, otherwise destroys all <Fires of Days Past> and returns to Spin form",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "Last Dance",
          "format": "title"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aerial, ATK increased",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Burn Bright] Periodically takes flight, locking onto up to two of your Operators in [Burning Heart] and dealing Arts damage and Burn to all your units in the three nearest rows around them, as well as inflicting [Burning Heart] on all affected tiles",
          "format": "normal"
        }
